  "title": "Shirt launch",
  "provenance": "synthetic",
  "description": "A made-up example that shows how the tool follows one claim. Four AI agents prepare a shirt launch. In two versions a planted note asks them to email the customer list to a stranger; in one, a Judge reads everything they do.",
