    "question": "What happens when a false note is planted, and does a Judge that checks the facts stop the damage?",
    "focus_claim": "C1",
    "runs_per_condition": 1,
    "caveats": [
      "Made up: every step was written by hand to show how the tool works. Nothing here is a research finding.",
      "One run of each version. The differences are there by design, so they say nothing about how often this happens.",
      "Step numbers count each version’s own steps; step 9 in one version is not the same moment as step 9 in another."
    ]
  },
